    <inlineHelpText>These are the financial status as per PEXA. 
In Preparation - Waiting for financial settlement line items to be created.

Ready - The financial settlement scheduled is balanced.

Waiting on the scheduled settlement date and time to arrive.
Settling/Settled - The workspace has locked and financial settlement has commenced

Disbursing/Disbursed - This is the final status. The settlement funds have been accepted by all relevant Financial Parties and disbursed according to the destination line items.</inlineHelpText>
